# U32: the build's item list (ItemListControl) of allflame_exp_001. Hover a row (the
# AddValueTooltip stand-in, no slot); Sort (SortItemList, UpdateList); Ctrl+click the first row
# twice (unequip from its primary slot, equip again: SetSelItemId, PopulateSlots, AddUndoState,
# buildFlag); select row 2 and Ctrl+C (OnSelCopy: Copy of BuildRaw with CRLF); double-click it
# (SetDisplayItem with a copy of the item); drag row 1 below row 3 (the reorder writes through to
# itemOrderList: OnOrderChange); the loadout filter: "Unused Items" (the filtered list,
# isMutable false) and back to "Any Loadout"; drag row 1 onto the Ring 2 slot; select row 4 and
# press DELETE (OnSelDelete: the "equipped" confirm popup) and RETURN (DeleteItem).
#! u32-expect ^7slot nil db nil
#! u32-expect Unused Items
#! u32-expect Delete Item
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 3
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 800 72
frames 2
move 883 53
